// Clue Name :
"P2929428887" "Chameleon Suit"
// DetailString :
"P2724758534" "This cybernetic suit will make any opponent perceive you as a friend. The illusion will last until you attack them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - StolenCyberware 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3515394660" "Stolen Chameleon Suit"
// DetailString :
"P2512677303" "This version of the suit has been modified by the Freakshow to imitate specific members of the Paragon City government."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4082536658" "The Freakshow are always on the lookout for new technology they can put to use causing mayhem. Their leader, a man called Dreck, recently ordered the Freakshow to steal a holographic disguise suit that was in development over at the university. They got away with one of the two prototypes, but the second one was saved by a quick-thinking student. That's where you come in. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to infiltrate the Freakshow and recover the stolen Chameleon Suit.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1028857131" "Infiltrate the Freakshow and recover the stolen Chameleon Suit"
// SendOffString :
"P2318824299" "The Chameleon Suit only has a limited power supply. It should last about 15 minutes."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2471517257" "Recover stolen Chameleon Suit"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2290834039" "You have no time to waste on this one, {HeroName}. You need to act quickly to get that Chameleon Suit back."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3036176166" "Nothing seems unusual to you about this sewer section, but you know that somewhere within lurks an army of dangerous Freaks."

