// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Freakshow_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2447873425" "Every faction of the Freakshow follows the word of one man, the leader they call Dreck. Dreck's latest edict is for the Freakshow to take every possible opportunity to defeat the city's heroes and prove that they have the power to rule the city. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The city's heroes will just have to take the fight right back to them.</a> I've heard that the Freaks are particularly active in Talos Island and Independence Port, but they'll most likely confront you anywhere you go."
// AcceptString :
"P50108538" "Take the fight back to the Freakshow"
// SendOffString :
"P3937664904" "The Freakshow can be tenacious, but I think you've got what it takes to beat them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P953839591" "Combat Freakshow menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2734029378" "I'm not sure the Freakshow have gotten your message yet. Maybe you should take down a couple more."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4005359163" "You have discouraged the Freaks from challenging heroes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3602541851" "I understand that Dreck has stepped back from his latest edict to the Freakshow. He hasn't mentioned you by name, but I think he was a little alarmed by the way you stepped up to the challenge."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Freakshow_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3404081929" "There are rumors around that the Freakshow is planning something in Talos Island to protest the capture of Upstart, one of their faction leaders. So far, they don't seem to have any plans, but if the number of Freaks reaches a critical mass, they won't need a plan to set the whole zone on fire. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>It would be a good thing if you could head off the Freaks' violence.</A> I've heard that a lot of them are congregating near New Thebes and Argo Highway, but you can probably find Freakshow all over."
// AcceptString :
"P3583942251" "Head off the Freaks' violence"
// SendOffString :
"P1026173106" "As I mentioned, the Freaks don't seem to have a plan, yet, so there's still time. A few public defeats by heroes such as yourself should cool them down."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2670224881" "Defeat Freakshow in Talos Island"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2477787026" "I'm still worried that the Freaks may try something big in Talos Island. Get over there, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2035507052" "You have prevented an outbreak of violence from the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1223644351" "You've reminded the Freakshow that the city's protectors are watching. The people of Paragon City owe you again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Freakshow_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P757235007" "The Terra Volta reactor powers the force fields that keep the civilized parts of the city safe, so it's become quite a target for extremist groups like the Freakshow. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to Terra Volta and make it clear that the Freaks don't belong anywhere near that reactor.</A> Reactor technicians have reported seeing Freakshow near the Challenger Technology Complex and the Raysun Petroleum facility. Maybe you should start in one of those areas."
// AcceptString :
"P3661700804" "Make it clear that the Freaks don't belong anywhere near the reactor."
// SendOffString :
"P2158197018" "Terra Volta's pretty scary these days. I'd recommend taking some allies with you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2076873164" "Combat Freakshow in Terra Volta"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P650850200" "Terra Volta is on the brink of chaos, {HeroName}. The city is depending on you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2354097209" "You have discouraged the Freakshow from meddling with the reactor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3695135890" "It's heroes like you who keep Terra Volta running. You've done good work today, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Freakshow_Mission2.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Weapons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1490406104" "Advanced weapons"
// DetailString :
"P1812311800" "These weapons are all highly advanced, some of them bordering on the exotic. You can only imagine how much havoc the Freakshow could have wrought with them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1660688017" "There's been a great deal of chaos on the streets of the city, and a good deal of it has been started by a gang called the Freakshow. This highly factionalized group of nihilistic anarchists has become dangerous, fueled by a drug called Excelsior and their unwavering hatred of 'the system.' Their tenacity and wild abandon make them dangerous opponents. I just got a tip that the Freakshow have raided the Lockhart Aerotech weapons lab and made off with a mighty arsenal. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you retrieve the stolen weapons from the Freakshow?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2981560247" "Retrieve the stolen weapons from the Freakshow"
// SendOffString :
"P4132794915" "The Freakshow aren't just thugs with guns. They're well armed, well equipped, and crazy. With all of the Excelsior in their systems, many Freaks can barely feel pain. What's more, lots of them have undergone radical cybernetic surgery to turn themselves into walking death machines. So this isn't going to be easy."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1798707832" "Defeat Freak leader, his crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P810309875" "You need to get those stolen weapons back from the Freaks. We can't have them running around with Lockhart's weapons technology."
// TaskTitle :
"P2634405544" "Retrieve Stolen Weapons From The Freakshow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2898220251" "Scientific notes litter the floor, each one detailing advances that are now part of the Freakshow's arsenal."

