// Dialog :
"P1836951498" "You saved a lot of important items from the Freakshow, {HeroName}. You should be proud. As for the Freakshow's aim: well, I guess they didn't have one, apart from rampant destruction. That's how the Freaks entertain themselves. It's too bad it's the rest of society that pays the price."
