// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P397773123" "Everything was destroyed? All of it? It's a shame, {HeroName}, a crying shame. I don't think the Freakshow even had an goal in mind, apart from rampant destruction. That's how the Freaks entertain themselves. It's too bad it's the rest of society that pays the price."
